ntainers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin064-qin-mother","subject_person_id":"2tx_lqb_26u","object_person_id":"tqk_46q_by1","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"康王正妃周氏所生"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simaqin","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simaqin-ws2622004","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simaqin:p001","quote":"及沖太孫薨，齊王冏表曰：「東宮曠然，塚嗣莫繼。天下大業，帝王神器，必建儲副，以固洪基。今者後宮未有孕育，不可庶幸將來而虛天緒，非祖宗之遺志，社稷之長計也。禮，兄弟之子猶子，故漢成無嗣，繼由定陶；孝和之絕，安以紹興。此先王之令典，往代之成式也。清河王覃神姿岐嶷，慧智早成，康王正妃周氏所生，先帝眾孫之中，於今為嫡。昔薄姬賢明，文則承位。覃外祖恢世載名德，覃宜奉宗廟之重，統無窮之祚，以甯四海顒顒之望。覃兄弟雖並出紹，可簡令淑還為國胤，不替其嗣。輒諮大將軍穎及群公卿士，咸同大願。請具禮儀，擇日迎拜。」遂立覃為皇太子。既而河間王顒協遷大駕，表成都王穎為皇太弟，廢覃復為清河王。初，覃為清河世子，所佩金鈴欻生隱起如麻粟，祖母陳太妃以為不祥，毀而賣之。占者以金是晉行大興之祥，覃為皇胤，是其瑞也。毀而賣之，象覃見廢不終之驗也。永嘉初，前北軍中候任城呂雍、度支校尉陳顏等謀立覃為太子，事覺，幽于金墉城。未幾，被害，時年十四，葬以庶人禮。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simaqin:p001:m0121","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simaqin:p001:m0139"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"齊王冏表述。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simaqin:p001:m0139","surface":"周氏","start":139,"end":141,"person_id":"tqk_46q_by1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simaqin:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simaqin"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin064-qin-mother","subject_person_id":"2tx_lqb_26u","object_person_id":"tqk_46q_by1","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"康王正妃周氏所生"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-sim